Long seen by the Forsaken as a natural expansion to their dominion, Sylvanas Windrunner\'s armies are ready to defend their most recent conquest at all costs.', 16712190, 'Driven from their homelands by the Forsaken, Gilneans continue to view this city as their nation\'s rightful capital.

